close_reason: "Reverified current main ce948522e18a: merged #92 (ce94852); source tree exactly matches the audited snapshot. **Lift the prefix learner's capacity bound: content-addressed checkpoint artifacts instead of the 4096-byte staging record.** [PR #92](https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rl/pull/92) (ce94852) stores large checkpoints as content-addressed blobs and retains checked receipt digests; capacity/corruption regressions and measured acceptance are committed."
